**Bottom line**
Sell to open **3 × NVDA Nov 13, 2026 $230 calls** in your **Roth IRA (••0216)** at a **$2.73 limit** ($819 total premium) and **2 × NVDA Nov 13, 2026 $230 calls** in your **Individual account (••8827)** at **$2.73** ($546 total premium), for **$1,365 combined**. The 26-day Nov 13 expiration sits inside the 25–45 DTE sweet spot and closes four days before NVIDIA's confirmed Nov 17 earnings report. Neither the Roth IRA nor the Individual account is accessible to this agent (`••3771` is the only agent-tradable account and holds no shares or options level), so you will need to place these orders directly in the Robinhood app.

